title: Analytics › Monthly report › Download the files
route: /analytics
intro: When the report is ready the window offers two real files, a written report and the figures as a table. In the hosted preview, where the host page blocks downloads, both buttons only explain why nothing happens. There is no Print and no PDF.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the files hold exactly the figures on the page, and are named from the period and payer, for example psyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all.md.
---
start s1 "Window shows 'Your report is ready'"
screen sc "Two buttons side by side\n'Download report' (dark)\n'Download data (CSV)'\nFooter button 'Done'"

click c1 "Click 'Download report'"
click c2 "Click 'Download data (CSV)'"
decision q1 "Is this the hosted preview?\n(the host page blocks downloads and printing)"
toast t1 "'Download is off in this preview'\n'Open the single-file version of the demo to use it.'"
process p0 "No file is made and no second toast\nThe window stays open"

group gFile "In the single-file demo"
  doc f1 "Markdown file\npsyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all.md"
  doc f2 "CSV file\npsyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all.csv"
  process p1 "Browser saves the file to the person's computer"
  toast t2 "'Report downloaded'\n'psyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all.md has the figures you see on this page.'"
  process p2 "Window stays open, so the other file can be saved too"
endgroup

process n1 "Name pattern: psyflo-monthly-report, then the period (quarter, last_quarter, year), then the payer (all or cardinal, summit ...)"
doc d1 "Production, not in the demo\nOne PDF monthly pack, aggregate only, drafted on the first business day\nThe operator approves it before it is sent"

click k1 "Click 'Done', press Escape, click the X or click outside"
end e1 "Window closes, back on Analytics"
goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › What the files contain"

s1 --> sc
sc --> c1 & c2
c1 & c2 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| t1 --> p0 --> k1
q1 -->|No| p1 --> t2 --> p2 --> k1
p1 --> f1 & f2
f1 & f2 --> n1
f1 & f2 --> g1
sc --> k1
k1 --> e1
sc -.-> d1
